Rym: Yeah, I got nothing for you.

602
00:42:35,845 --> 00:42:36,996
Rym: I'm taking work off this week.

603
00:42:37,077 --> 00:42:40,431
Rym: That's why I was dressed in my running stuff doing GeekNights.

604
00:42:40,917 --> 00:42:43,460
Rym: But GeekNights will mostly be on its regular schedule.

605
00:42:44,182 --> 00:42:46,128
Rym: Hope to see some of you at PAX Unplugged.

606
00:42:46,855 --> 00:42:52,150
Rym: Hope to see some of you at MAGFest, where I will tell you now in advance, we do have several panels.

607
00:42:52,291 --> 00:42:53,339
